<title>USA: Trans World Airlines seeks Madrid route.</title>
<headline>Trans World Airlines seeks Madrid route.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans World Airlines Inc said Friday it is seeking approval from Spain to begin daily non-stop service between St. Louis and Madrid.</p>
<p>If approved by Spain, service would begin June 15, using Boeing Co 767 aircraft, the airline said.</p>
<p>TWA shares were down 3/16 at 7-7/8 Friday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
